      </div>

      <h2>1. Brand Ownership & Legal Entity</h2>
      <p>
        Avomeal is not a separate legal entity. It is a commercial brand and food service line operated under <strong>VNV Events LLC</strong>.
      </p>

      <p>
        All customer service, food preparation, order fulfillment, delivery coordination, business operations, and legal responsibilities related to Avomeal are managed under <strong>VNV Events LLC</strong>, including any permits, kitchen operations, and applicable regulatory compliance.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Scope of Service</h2>
