        <li>Submitting an order does not guarantee acceptance until confirmed by our system.</li>
        <li>We may reject, limit, delay, cancel, or modify any order at our discretion.</li>
        <li>Menu items, ingredients, sides, garnishes, and presentation may vary based on availability and production conditions.</li>
        <li>Product photos and descriptions are for illustrative purposes and may not reflect the exact final presentation.</li>
      </ul>

