        <li>Meals should be refrigerated promptly unless otherwise noted.</li>
        <li>Meals should be reheated and consumed according to reasonable food safety practices.</li>
        <li>Customers are responsible for ensuring meals are stored at appropriate temperatures and consumed within a reasonable timeframe.</li>
